{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6e34c450-99fa-89ef-b3d5-1e5df03f57ae",
  "created_at": "2026-03-12T14:13:40-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ricardo Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:09:09-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:09:15-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I'm calling about a dip in the road down the Point. Where a trench got cut and patched, and it's settled since. It's wicked low now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:09:29-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a utility trench that's sunk. Where is this exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:09:35-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "21 Bridge Street. Right out front of the house, basically. I rent the place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:09:43-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-one Bridge Street, got it. And how big a dip are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:09:51-04:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It runs maybe, I don't know, eight or ten feet along the street, and it's a few inches down at the deepest. Cars hit it and the whole thing bangs. Kind of like when you order a cabinet and they bring you a milkshake. Sorry, that's a Rhode Island thing. A cabinet is a milkshake, with ice cream in it. Anyway, it's a real thump."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:10:23-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I know the cabinet. So it's a thump when vehicles go over it. Is it a through street with a lot of traffic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:10:36-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's on the bus route. The bus comes down every half hour or so, and it really slams in there. I hear it from inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:10:50-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good to know, the bus route bumps up how we look at it. Do you know which utility dug it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:11:02-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for sure. There were guys out there in the fall, I think for gas or maybe water. They filled it and put the black patch on top, and over the winter it just sank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:11:20-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens a lot after the freeze and thaw. Okay, let me get this written down. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:11:31-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ricardo Castillo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:11:33-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:11:38-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. C, A, S, T, I, L, L, O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:11:43-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "C-A-S-T-I-L-L-O. And the first name, with a C or an S? Ricardo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:11:50-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, a C. R-I-C-A-R-D-O. Wait, did you say S? No, C like cat. Sorry, you said the letter and I thought you meant the one in Castillo, the S, T part. It's a C."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:12:07-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, they sound alike on the phone. C as in cat. R-I-C-A-R-D-O Castillo. Good. Best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:12:18-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:12:19-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, 401-555-0197. So what I have is a settled utility trench on Bridge Street at number 21, a few inches deep, on the bus route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:12:32-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Can you add the street to the repair list? I just want it on there so somebody comes out and looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:12:45-04:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put it on the list for the crew to check. I can't tell you the exact day they'll get to it, since there's a pile of requests this time of year, but it'll be logged with the bus route noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:13:06-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. Should I call back if it gets worse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:13:12-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, if it gets worse or if you see a crack opening up, call us and we'll add it to the request. And if it's an emergency, like a hole that swallows a tire, tell us right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:13:31-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:13:34-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ricardo. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:13:38-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
